KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - Economics (Year 2021)

Q1. When the price elasticity of demand is greater than 1, a price reduction leads to:
  (A) Decrease in total revenue
  (B) Increase in total revenue
  (C) Constant revenue
  (D) Zero revenue
  Answer: B - With elastic demand (Ed > 1), quantity demanded rises proportionally more than price drops, boosting total revenue.


